# Backup
*.bak
*.backup
*_backup.*

# Portable Node runtime (~90MB unpacked; intentionally NOT tracked - rollback relies
# on keeping the previous directory on disk, see UPGRADE-OPTIMIZATION-GUIDE.md).
# Listed explicitly rather than as node-v*-win-x64/ because the older
# node-v22.22.1-win-x64/ still has ~36 deliberately tracked files (top-level shims +
# node.exe); a wildcard here would be misleading about their status.
# When a new runtime is introduced, add it here as its own line.
node-v22.23.2-win-x64/

# Timestamped backup files. The generic *.bak rule above misses these because the
# timestamp/suffix comes AFTER .bak (e.g. refresh_token.py.bak-clienthash-20260811-0900).
# Several of them hold credentials, so they must never be committed.
*.bak-*
*.bak.*
.env.bak*
*.migrated
